{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_32_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，王正月，溺會齊師伐衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"溺者何也？公子溺也。其不稱公子何也？惡其會仇仇而伐同姓，故貶而名之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，葬宋莊公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"月葬，故也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"三、五月，葬桓王。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"傳曰，改葬也。改葬之禮，緦，舉下，緬也。或曰，郤屍以求諸侯。天子志崩不志葬，必其時也。何必焉？舉天下而葬一人，其義不疑也。志葬，故也，危不得葬也。曰，近不失崩，不志崩，失天下也。獨陰不生，獨陽不生，獨天不生，三合然後生。故曰，母之子也可，天之子也可。尊者，取尊稱焉；卑者，取卑稱焉。其曰王者，民之所歸往也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"四、秋，紀季以攜入於齊也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"攜，紀之邑也。入於齊者，以攜事齊也。入者，內弗受也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"五、冬，公次於郎。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_32_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_32","textTraditional":"次，止也，有畏也，欲救紀而不能也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}